      "id": "e462e0fbe5ce0e59",
      "title": "Celebrate Mean Girls Mania!",
      "description": "Take Advantage of Mean Girls Offers Throughout Downtown Aurora! \n\nShopping local? That’s so fetch!\nCelebrate Mean Girls Mania with deals, promos, raffles, giveaways, and so much more at your favorite Downtown Aurora stores, restaurants, and galleries!\n\n  \n\nRESTAURANT/BAR/CAFÉ\n\n\nAltiro Latin Fusion • 1 S. Stolp Ave. • Is There Alcohol in This?\n\nFeel like Regina George’s mom with our 2 special Mean Girls cocktails and themed brunch with DJ, Glitter Station, and Mean Girls Photo Box.\n\n\nAmore Mio Italian Restaurant • 33 W. New York St. • Is Butter a Carb?\n\n$30 Girl Dinner Special: 1 Cocktail, 1 Pasta, and 1 Side Dish\nAvailable Tuesday-Thursday.\n\n\nCharlie’s Creamery • 6 E. Downer Pl. • Why Are You So Obsessed With Me?\n\nCelebrate Mean Girls with our limited-edition dairy-free ‘Regina Raspberry’ flavor!\nTicket holders get $1 off their scoop when presenting a Paramount ticket stub.\n\n\nCraft Urban • 41 S. Stolp Ave. • If You’re Gonna Drink, I’d Rather You Do it in the House\n\nEnjoy our awesome Mean Girls themed cocktail menu.\n\n\nGiardino Trattoria & Pizzeria • 12 N. River St. • That’s So Fetch\n\nEvery Wednesday from August 26 – October 11, 2026, wear pink to Giardino and enjoy a complimentary* appetizer or dessert, plus a voucher for a free* appetizer on your next visit.\nToast the occasion with our limited-edition Pink Cocktail, perfect for making memories with your people.\nReserve your table at eatatgiardino.com\n*Limit one complimentary item per table, per visit. Up to $15 value. $10 minimum purchase required.\n\n\nKai Modern Japanese Kitchen • 2 N. River St. • I Want My Pink Shirt Back!\n\nJoin us for Pink Wednesdays and enjoy our Special Pink Cocktail\nEvery Wednesday from August 26 – October 11, 2026, wear pink to Kai and receive a complimentary* appetizer or maki roll, plus a coupon for a free* appetizer on your next visit.\nPair your meal with our exclusive Pink Wednesday Cocktail!\nMake your reservation at kaijapanesekitchen.com\n*Limit one complimentary item per table, per visit. Up to $15 value. $10 minimum purchase required.\n\n\nLa Quinta de los Reyes • 36 E. New York St. #52 • You Girls Keep Me Young\n\nGrab our Pink Lime Margarita for just $8.\nDress in pink and get $5 dollars off, and don’t forget to stop by our photo display!\nOnly on Wednesdays.\n\n\nLegacy Nutrition & Fitness • 77 S. River St. • Oh, it’s, Like, Slang. From England.\n\nShow a Mean Girls ticket or confirmation and receive $1 off our That’s So Fetch themed drink.\n\n\nMich Big Taco • 31 N. Broadway • I Can’t Go to 🌮 🔔!\n\nEnjoy our Taco Special before the showing or our Whole Enchilada and Pink Horchata during the movie!\n\n\nSubway • 5 E. Downer Pl. • On Wednesdays, We Save at Subway\n\nGet 10% off your order, only on Wednesdays.\n\n\nTouché French Creole • 6 N. River St. • You Go, Glen Coco!\n\nEvery Wednesday from August 26 – October 11, 2026, wear pink to Touché and receive a complimentary* appetizer or dessert, plus a voucher for a free* appetizer on a future visit.\nSip our exclusive Pink cocktail creation and celebrate in French Creole style.\nBook at touchefrenchcreole.com\n*Limit one complimentary item per table, per visit. Up to $15 value. $10 minimum purchase required.\n\n\nTwo Brothers Roundhouse • 205 N. Broadway • I’m a Cool Mom \n\nDon’t miss our Cool Mom Martini—a bright and fresh martini with limoncello and raspberry liquor.\nTasty and (of course) pink!\nCheck out our Mean Girls photo display while you’re here.\n\n\n\n  \n\nRETAIL STORE/BOUTIQUE\n\n\nNide Jardin • 140 S. River St. Unit 106 • I Can’t Help it That I’m Popular\n\nWear pink on Wednesdays and get 10% off your purchase.\n\n\nOffbeat Vintage Collective • 112 E. Galena Blvd. • Get in Loser, We’re Going Shopping\n\nThat’s so fetch!\nShop our Mean Girls inspired secondhand capsule collection.\n\n\nYellow Bird Books • 34 S. Stolp Ave. • She Doesn’t Even Go Here!\n\nShow your plastics’ pride and shop our Mean Girls themed merchandise.\n\n\n\n  \n\nMUSEUM/GALLERY\nFrench 75 Gallery & Lounge • 56 E. Galena Blvd. • The Limit Does Not Exist!\n\nGet 10% off Mean Girls Themed Cocktails.\n\n\nSociety 57 • 100 S. River St. • I Wish I Could Bake a Cake Filled with Rainbows and Smiles\n\nEnjoy our Mean Girls themed specialty coffee drink featuring cherry and chocolate.\n\n\nDownload the entire Mean Girls Event Calendar here for a handy guide!\n\nMean Girl offers vary. Check with local stores, restaurants, and other businesses for restrictions.\nAurora Downtown District – where culture, creativity, and cuisine collide! From globally inspired cuisine and one-of-a-kind shops to live entertainment and inspiring public art, downtown Aurora is designed to be experienced. Just 45 minutes from Chicago, our downtown business district offers an urban vibe that’s bold, creative, and unmistakably Aurora. Welcome to Illinois’ second-largest city with a small-town feel!",
